{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"curl -sS https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/ -o /tmp/prodigi-reference.html\nprintf 'Reference excerpts\\\\n'\nrg -n -i 'sandbox\\\\.prodigi|create order|merchantReference|shippingMethod|GLOBAL-|printArea|sizing|Products/' /tmp/prodigi-reference.html | sed -n '1,220p'\nprintf '\\\\nOrders response shape\\\\n'\ncurl -sS -H \\\"X-API-Key: \"'$PRODIGI_API_KEY\" https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders -o /tmp/prodigi-orders.json\njq '\"'{keys:keys, outcome:.outcome, orderCount:(.orders|length), first:(.orders[0] // null)}' /tmp/prodigi-orders.json | sed -n '1,180p'\nprintf '\\\\nStripe profile metadata\\\\n'\nstripe config --list 2>/dev/null | sed -E 's/(test_mode_api_key|live_mode_api_key|publishable_key|api_key)[[:space:]]*=.*/\\\\1 = [redacted]/' | sed -n '1,120p'\"","aggregated_output":"Reference excerpts\n384:                    <a href=\"#create-order\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"Create order\">Create order</a>\n564:<li>Sandbox API: <strong>api.sandbox.prodigi.com</strong></li>\n601:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"merchantReference\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"MyMerchantReference1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n602:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Overnight\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n644:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"merchantReference\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"item #1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n645:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n647:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n654:                    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n706:<td><code>merchantReference</code></td>\n712:<td><code>shippingMethod</code></td>\n1167:<td><code>merchantReference</code></td>\n1185:<td><code>sizing</code></td>\n1188:<td>The sizing strategy for us to use. The value should be one of <code>fillPrintArea</code>, <code>fitPrintArea</code> or <code>stretchToPrintArea</code>. More information can be found in our <a href=\"#order-object-image-resizing\" title=\"Image resizing\">image resizing section</a>.</td>\n1221:<td><code>printArea</code></td>\n1289:We use <code>idempotencyKey</code> to check for duplicates rather than <code>merchantReference</code> as it's not uncommon for merchants to order reprints of an order using the same <code>merchantReference</code>.\n1291:<h3 id='order-object-image-resizing'>Image resizing</h3>\n1294:<p>However, you can also specify a sizing parameter to change this behaviour.</p>\n1298:<th>Sizing mode</th>\n1304:<td><code>fillPrintArea</code></td>\n1309:<td><code>fitPrintArea</code></td>\n1314:<td><code>stretchToPrintArea</code></td>\n1324:<p>Pwinty will automatically try to rotate your images so that they need the least possible resizing to fit the product size. For example, if you are creating a 10 x 15 photo, and upload an image that is 4500px x 3000px, then Pwinty will flip it round so it is 3000px x 4500px and thus fits the photo perfectly. </p>\n1326:                <h2 id='create-order'>Create order</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">POST</span><span>/v4.0/orders</span>\n1327:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1333:        \"merchantReference\": \"MyMerchantReference1\",\n1334:        \"shippingMethod\": \"Overnight\",\n1358:                \"merchantReference\": \"item #1\",\n1359:                \"sku\": \"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\",\n1361:                \"sizing\": \"fillPrintArea\",\n1371:                        \"printArea\": \"default\",\n1397:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"merchantReference\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"MyMerchantReference1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1398:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Overnight\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1440:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"merchantReference\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"item #1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1441:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1443:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1450:                        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1482:<h3 id='create-order-create-order-outcomes'>Create order outcomes</h3>\n1515:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/orders/ord_677258\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1526:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"merchantReference\"</span><s