pan><span class=\"w\">\n1804:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/orders/ord_123456/actions/cancel\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1815:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"merchantReference\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"MyMerchantReference1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1816:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Overnight\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1848:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"merchantReference\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"item #1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1849:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1851:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1858:                        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1936:                <h2 id='update-shipping-method'>Update shipping method</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">POST</span><span>/v4.0/orders/{prodigi_order_id}/actions/updateShippingMethod</span>\n1937:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders/ord_123456/actions/updateShippingMethod\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1940:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</spa