{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The API validation found two real Prodigi garment SKUs that closely match the original choices: Bella + Canvas 6004 for “Fitted” and Bella + Canvas 3003 for “Unisex,” both in black and with front print areas. I’m using a webhook-first fulfillment design with idempotency keyed to the Stripe Checkout Session, plus a success-page recovery check so a temporary webhook delay can’t strand a paid order. Artwork is generated as a high-resolution transparent PNG from the frozen purchase timestamp and served through a signed URL for Prodigi to fetch."}}
