{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_59","type":"agent_message","text":"The retry test exposed a worthwhile real-world edge case before handoff: Prodigi correctly returns `AlreadyExists` for the same idempotency key, but my client was treating that safe duplicate as an error. I’m correcting that response handling and adding a regression test; this is exactly the path Stripe webhook retries use during transient failures."}}
